SCRIPT - DESCRIPTION
---------------------
api/ - Python XML-RPC API test scripts
build-jar-dir - builds jar directory for create-webapp-dir task
docker-checkstyle.sh - runs checkstyle in a container
docker-testing-pgsql.sh - runs the tests against a PostgreSQL container
maven/ - Maven migration helper files
migrate-branding-to-mvn - helper to migrate branding to Maven
migrate-spacewalk-java-to-mvn - helper to migrate spacewalk-java to Maven
migrate-tests/ - helpers to migrate the test suite to Maven
missingstrings.sh - lists translation strings that are missing
mvn-migrate - helper for the Maven migration
pack-i18n - packs translation files for translation
publish-war - deploys the built webapp to a remote host
refreshi18n.sh - refreshes the i18n string resources
slocc.sh - counts lines of code, comments, and prints their ratios
spelling/ - spelling checker data
taskomatic - TaskomaticDaemon start script
taskomatic.service - systemd unit file for Taskomatic
unittest.xml - Ant/JUnit configuration fragment for the unit tests
unpack-i18n - unpacks translation files
updateheader.py - adds or updates the license header on source files
